---
title: MCP Discovery, Selection, and Tool Memory
---
flowchart TB
    Servers[[Configured MCP servers]] --> Discover[Read live tool catalog]
    Discover --> Inspect{Safe description<br/>and stable schema?}
    Inspect -->|no| Quarantine[Quarantine descriptor]
    Inspect -->|yes| Index[Embed safe descriptor]
    Index --> Inference[Provider-neutral<br/>inference adapter]
    Inference -->|embedding role| Nomic[Nomic text embedding<br/>via vLLM]
    Nomic --> Store[(Tool descriptors<br/>in pgvector)]

    Chat([Chat request]) --> Shortlist[Semantic tool shortlist]
    Store --> Shortlist
    Preferences[(Approved preferences<br/>and sanitized outcomes)] --> Shortlist
    Shortlist --> Inference
    Inference -->|main role| Select[Qwen 3.5 4B via vLLM<br/>native tool selection]

    Explicit([Explicit tool call]) --> Gates
    Select --> Gates[Application invocation gates<br/>trust, confirmation, live schema,<br/>arguments and privacy]
    Gates -->|allowed| Server[[Selected MCP tool]]
    Gates -->|refused| Status[Visible tool status]
    Server --> Result[Bounded result<br/>as untrusted data]
    Result --> Inference
    Inference -->|main role| Answer[Qwen 3.5 4B via vLLM<br/>final answer]
    Result --> Status

    MemoryAPI([Tool-memory API]) --> Validate[Ownership and safe fields]
    Validate --> Preferences
    Validate --> Store

